        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pill Bird Remastered is a fast, skill-driven 2D platformer about control, rhythm, and momentum. You play as a small, color-shifting bird built for speed, flight, and precision. Every world tests how well you can move, dashing through hazards, threading between traps, and holding perfect lines through impossible-looking gaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each color form gives a different ability: burst dashes that kill on impact, invincible charges, aura attacks, projectiles, and so on. Timing them right is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remaster rebuilds the original from the ground up with tighter physics, cleaner visuals, and just overall better everything. The goal? Finish all worlds as quickly as possible, test your skills and become the best flier. </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pill Bird Remastered is a fast, skill-driven 2D platformer about control, rhythm, and momentum. You play as a small, color-shifting bird built for speed, flight, and precision. Every world tests how well you can move, dashing through hazards, threading between traps, and holding perfect lines through impossible-looking gaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each color form gives a different ability: burst dashes that kill on impact, invincible charges, aura attacks, projectiles, and so on. Timing them right is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remaster rebuilds the original from the ground up with tighter physics, cleaner visuals, and just overall better everything. The goal? Finish all worlds as quickly as possible, test your skills and become the best flier. </p>",
